{"seq":3,"slug":"transportation-freight-management","title":"运输与货运管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/transportation-freight-management","wordCount":1515,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"运输与货运管理\">运输与货运管理</h1><p>运输是供应链中成本占比最高的单一环节——通常占物流总成本的 40-60%。运输管理（Transportation Management）的核心是在成本、时效和可靠性三个约束中寻找最优解。2026 年，AI 动态路由规划、自动驾驶卡车试运营、以及碳排放约束下的绿色运输正在重塑这一领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-运输模式与选择\">核心概念：运输模式与选择</h2><p>不同运输模式的特征对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运输模式</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>成本/kg</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公路（LTL/FTL）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>国内中短途、门到门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁路</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>大宗/远距离陆运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海运</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>国际贸易、大批量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空运</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高价值/紧急/生鲜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多式联运</td>\n<td>按组合</td>\n<td>优化后最低</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中欧班列、海铁联运</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>运输模式的选择取决于货物特性（价值密度、时效要求、体积重量比）和网络特性（距离、频次、路由可达性）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 国际干线&#10;        O[海外工厂] --&gt;|海运 25-35天| P1[港口]&#10;        O --&gt;|空运 3-5天| AP[空港]&#10;        O --&gt;|铁路 15-20天| RL[铁路口岸]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 国内干线&#10;        P1 --&gt; CDC[中央仓]&#10;        AP --&gt; CDC&#10;        RL --&gt; CDC&#10;        CDC --&gt;|公路整车 FTL| RDC[区域仓]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 末端配送&#10;        RDC --&gt;|公路零担 LTL| HUB[配送站]&#10;        HUB --&gt;|面包车/电动车| C[消费者]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 国际干线\n        O[海外工厂] --&gt;|海运 25-35天| P1[港口]\n        O --&gt;|空运 3-5天| AP[空港]\n        O --&gt;|铁路 15-20天| RL[铁路口岸]\n    end\n    subgraph 国内干线\n        P1 --&gt; CDC[中央仓]\n        AP --&gt; CDC\n        RL --&gt; CDC\n        CDC --&gt;|公路整车 FTL| RDC[区域仓]\n    end\n    subgraph 末端配送\n        RDC --&gt;|公路零担 LTL| HUB[配送站]\n        HUB --&gt;|面包车/电动车| C[消费者]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"整车与零担-装载率经济学\">整车与零担：装载率经济学</h2><p><strong>整车运输（FTL, Full Truckload）</strong> — 一辆车装满一个发货方的货物，直达目的地。优点是速度快、货损低；缺点是必须凑足整车量，否则空间浪费。</p>\n<p><strong>零担运输（LTL, Less-than-Truckload）</strong> — 多个发货方的货物拼在一辆车上。优点是灵活、适合小批量；缺点是中转次数多、时效慢、货损风险高。</p>\n<p>临界决策点：当发货量超过车辆容量的 70-80% 时，FTL 的单位成本通常低于 LTL。这意味着集中发货（减少频次、增大批量）可以有效降低运输成本——但代价是增加了库存和配送时效。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>Q</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cost_{per\\_unit} = \\begin{cases} \\frac{Rate_{FTL}}{Q} &amp; \\text{if } Q \\geq 0.75 \\times Cap \\\\ Rate_{LTL} \\times W &amp; \\text{if } Q &lt; 0.75 \\times Cap \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7146em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.7146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8886em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4103em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.2254em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2146em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7146em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.7146em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.2254em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2146em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 为发货量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cap</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为车辆容量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为货物重量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由优化-vrp-问题\">路由优化：VRP 问题</h2><p>车辆路径问题（Vehicle Routing Problem, VRP）是运输管理中的经典优化问题。标准 VRP 的目标是为一组车辆规划从仓库出发、服务多个客户点、再返回仓库的路线，使总行驶距离（或时间/成本）最小。</p>\n<p>VRP 的常见变体：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>附加约束</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CVRP（容量约束）</td>\n<td>每辆车有最大装载量</td>\n<td>配送车限重/限体积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VRPTW（时间窗）</td>\n<td>客户要求特定时间段到达</td>\n<td>B2C 预约配送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VRPPD（取送混合）</td>\n<td>同一趟既取货又送货</td>\n<td>逆向物流+正向配送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DVRP（动态）</td>\n<td>运输途中新增/取消订单</td>\n<td>即时配送平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>VRP 是 NP-hard 问题，实际生产中采用启发式算法求解：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>近邻法（Nearest Neighbor）</strong> — 贪心策略，每次访问最近的未服务客户。简单但解质量一般。</li>\n<li><strong>节约法（Clarke-Wright Savings）</strong> — 合并路线中节省最多距离的两条子路线。经典的构造式启发。</li>\n<li><strong>元启发式</strong> — 禁忌搜索、模拟退火、遗传算法。计算量大但解质量高，适合离线规划。</li>\n<li><strong>机器学习辅助</strong> — 2026 年的前沿方向：用强化学习生成初始解，再用局部搜索微调。Google DeepMind 的 OR 团队已展示 ML 在大规模 VRP 上接近专家启发式的表现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tms-系统架构\">TMS 系统架构</h2><p>运输管理系统（TMS, Transportation Management System）是运输决策的数字化载体。典型功能架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 计划层&#10;        RP[路由规划引擎]&#10;        CM[运力匹配]&#10;        RA[费率引擎]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 执行层&#10;        OE[订单执行/调度]&#10;        TT[在途追踪]&#10;        ED[电子单证 eBOL]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 结算层&#10;        FA[运费审核]&#10;        FP[结算付款]&#10;        KPI[绩效看板]&#10;    end&#10;    RP --&gt; OE&#10;    CM --&gt; OE&#10;    RA --&gt; FA&#10;    OE --&gt; TT&#10;    TT --&gt; KPI&#10;    FA --&gt; FP\">graph TB\n    subgraph 计划层\n        RP[路由规划引擎]\n        CM[运力匹配]\n        RA[费率引擎]\n    end\n    subgraph 执行层\n        OE[订单执行/调度]\n        TT[在途追踪]\n        ED[电子单证 eBOL]\n    end\n    subgraph 结算层\n        FA[运费审核]\n        FP[结算付款]\n        KPI[绩效看板]\n    end\n    RP --&gt; OE\n    CM --&gt; OE\n    RA --&gt; FA\n    OE --&gt; TT\n    TT --&gt; KPI\n    FA --&gt; FP</pre><p>2026 年 TMS 的演进方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>从规划到自主</strong> — AI 代理自动选择承运商、自动调度、自动处理异常（如延误时自动改派）</li>\n<li><strong>从可视到预测</strong> — 不只展示&quot;货在哪&quot;，还预测&quot;货什么时候到&quot;以及&quot;可能出什么问题&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>从单企到网络</strong> — 连接发货方、承运商、收货方的协同平台，实现运力共享和空驶率降低</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"运输成本结构与优化杠杆\">运输成本结构与优化杠杆</h2><p>运输成本由基础运价、附加费和隐性成本三部分构成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本构成</th>\n<th>典型占比</th>\n<th>优化杠杆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础运价</td>\n<td>60-70%</td>\n<td>规模议价、长约锁价、竞标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃油附加费</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n<td>路由优化减少里程、新能源车队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装卸/等待费</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>预约时间窗、提升装卸效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险/税费</td>\n<td>3-5%</td>\n<td>批量保险、合规路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货损/延误罚金</td>\n<td>2-5%</td>\n<td>包装优化、可靠承运商选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最有效的系统性优化杠杆通常不在压缩单一运价，而在网络层面：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>装载率优化</strong> — 将 FTL 平均装载率从 75% 提升到 90%，等效运价下降 17%</li>\n<li><strong>空驶率降低</strong> — 回程找货（Backhaul），将空驶率从 30% 降到 15%</li>\n<li><strong>模式转换</strong> — 非紧急件从空运转海运/铁路，成本可降 60-80%</li>\n<li><strong>合并运输</strong> — 多个小单合并为一单 FTL，消除 LTL 的中转和分摊溢价</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"绿色运输与碳排放管理\">绿色运输与碳排放管理</h2><p>2026 年 EU CSRD 和中国&quot;双碳&quot;政策将运输碳排放纳入企业披露要求。运输碳足迹计算基于 GLEC（Global Logistics Emissions Council）框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2 = Distance \\times Weight \\times EF_{mode}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF_{mode}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为各运输模式的排放因子（gCO2/tkm）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>排放因子（gCO2/tkm）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>公路（柴油卡车）</td>\n<td>62-100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁路（电力）</td>\n<td>5-15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海运（集装箱）</td>\n<td>8-16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空运</td>\n<td>500-600</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>减碳路径：模式转换（空运→海运可减碳 97%）&gt; 装载率优化 &gt; 路由优化 &gt; 车辆升级（电动/氢能）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>运输模式选择取决于货物价值密度、时效要求和批量大小的综合权衡。</li>\n<li>装载率是运输成本的核心杠杆：FTL vs LTL 的临界点约在车辆容量的 75%。</li>\n<li>VRP 是运输路由的核心优化问题，实际中用启发式/元启发式/ML 方法求解。</li>\n<li>TMS 正从&quot;规划+可视&quot;向&quot;自主决策+预测+网络协同&quot;演进。</li>\n<li>绿色运输的首选策略是模式转换，而非仅升级车辆动力。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"inventory-management-optimization\">库存管理与优化策略</a> — 运输频次与库存水位的联动关系</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ecommerce-logistics/last-mile-delivery/route-optimization\">电商物流：路线优化</a> — 末端配送的路由优化实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运输与货运管理","id":"运输与货运管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：运输模式与选择","id":"核心概念-运输模式与选择"},{"level":2,"text":"整车与零担：装载率经济学","id":"整车与零担-装载率经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"路由优化：VRP 问题","id":"路由优化-vrp-问题"},{"level":2,"text":"TMS 系统架构","id":"tms-系统架构"},{"level":2,"text":"运输成本结构与优化杠杆","id":"运输成本结构与优化杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"绿色运输与碳排放管理","id":"绿色运输与碳排放管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"仓配网络与分销设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/warehouse-distribution-network"},"next":{"title":"AI 驱动的智能供应链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/technology/ai-driven-supply-chain"}}